+    // EDEN_UP_STAGING_STEPS: a level also holds buffers smaller than its power of two, and one
+    // is handed out only when it holds the transfer. The console's is_free (prepare-vulkan-port.py)
+    // knows only a mapped buffer's size and takes a GPU-only one to be its power of two, so this
